@* فرم با فهرست رکوردهای همان فرم در کنار (جستجو، رفتن به رکورد دیگر در همان تب، رکورد جدید). *@
@inject TabService Tabs
@inject UiPrefs Prefs

<div class="form-with-list @(Prefs.SideListOpen ? "" : "list-closed")">
    <aside class="side-list no-print">
        @if (Prefs.SideListOpen)
        {
            <div class="side-list-head">
                <MudText Typo="Typo.subtitle2"><b>@Title</b></MudText>
                <MudSpacer />
                @if (NewUrl is not null)
                {
                    <MudTooltip Text="جدید"><MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Add" Size="Size.Small" Color="Color.Primary" OnClick="() => Tabs.Go(NewUrl)" aria-label="جدید" /></MudTooltip>
                }
                <MudTooltip Text="به‌روزرسانی"><MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Refresh" Size="Size.Small" OnClick="LoadAsync" aria-label="به‌روزرسانی" /></MudTooltip>
                <MudTooltip Text="بستن فهرست"><MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Outlined.KeyboardDoubleArrowRight" Size="Size.Small" OnClick="Toggle" aria-label="بستن فهرست" /></MudTooltip>
            </div>
            <MudTextField T="string" @bind-Value="_term" Immediate="true" Placeholder="جستجو در فهرست" Clearable="true"
                          Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Outlined.Search"
                          Variant="Variant.Outlined" Margin="Margin.Dense" Class="mb-2" />
            @if (_loading)
            {
                <MudProgressLinear Indeterminate="true" />
            }
            <div class="side-list-items">
                @foreach (var item in Visible)
                {
                    <div class="side-item @(IsCurrent(item) ? "current" : "")" @onclick="() => Open(item)">
                        <div class="side-item-row">
                            <span class="side-item-title">@item.Title</span>
                            @if (item.Amount is not null) { <span class="num side-item-amount">@item.Amount</span> }
                        </div>
                        @if (item.Subtitle is not null || item.Badge is not null)
                        {
                            <div class="side-item-row">
                                <span class="side-item-sub">@item.Subtitle</span>
                                @if (item.Badge is not null)
                                {
                                    <MudChip T="string" Size="Size.Small" Color="item.BadgeColor" Variant="Variant.Text" Class="ma-0">@item.Badge</MudChip>
                                }
                            </div>
                        }
                    </div>
                }
                @if (!_loading && _items.Count == 0)
                {
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Color="Color.Secondary" Class="pa-2">رکوردی ثبت نشده است.</MudText>
                }
                @if (_items.Count > MaxShown && Visible.Count() == MaxShown)
                {
                    <MudText Typo="Typo.caption" Color="Color.Secondary" Class="pa-2">@MaxShown مورد اول؛ برای بقیه جستجو کنید.</MudText>
                }
            </div>
        }
        else
        {
            <MudTooltip Text="@($"نمایش فهرست {Title}")" Placement="Placement.Left">
                <MudIconButton Icon="@Icons.Material.Outlined.ViewList" OnClick="Toggle" aria-label="نمایش فهرست" />
            </MudTooltip>
        }
    </aside>
    <div class="form-main">@ChildContent</div>
</div>

@code {
    private const int MaxShown = 200;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Title { get; set; } = "";
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public Func<Task<List<SideItem>>> Load { get; set; } = null!;
    [Parameter] public string? NewUrl { get; set; }
    /// <summary>نشانی رکورد جاری برای پررنگ کردن.</summary>
    [Parameter] public string? CurrentUrl { get; set; }
    /// <summary>با تغییر این عدد (مثلاً بعد از ذخیره) فهرست دوباره خوانده می‌شود.</summary>
    [Parameter] public int Version { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public RenderFragment? ChildContent { get; set; }

    private List<SideItem> _items = [];
    private string? _term;
    private bool _loading;
    private int _loadedVersion = -1;

    private IEnumerable<SideItem> Visible
    {
        get
        {
            var term = PersianText.NormalizeOrNull(_term);
            var q = term is null ? _items : _items.Where(i => i.SearchText.Contains(term));
            return q.Take(MaxShown);
        }
    }

    protected override async Task OnParametersSetAsync()
    {
        if (_loadedVersion == Version) return;
        _loadedVersion = Version;
        await LoadAsync();
    }

    private async Task LoadAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        try { _items = await Load(); }
        catch { _items = []; }
        _loading = false;
    }

    private bool IsCurrent(SideItem item) => CurrentUrl is not null && item.Url == CurrentUrl;

    private void Open(SideItem item)
    {
        if (IsCurrent(item)) return;
        Tabs.Go(item.Url);
    }

    private void Toggle() => Prefs.SideListOpen = !Prefs.SideListOpen;
}
